WEBVTT

00:19.720 --> 00:24.024
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.024 --> 00:28.729
Oto mo naku kokoro
ni fureru toki ni

00:28.729 --> 00:36.370
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura
ni wa kodoku no namida

00:36.370 --> 00:41.242
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.242 --> 00:52.052
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:52.052 --> 00:54.188
Mamoritai

00:54.188 --> 00:56.290
Shinjitai

00:56.290 --> 01:00.761
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.761 --> 01:05.032
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:05.032 --> 01:09.303
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.303 --> 01:12.940
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:12.940 --> 01:21.814
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:30.824 --> 01:34.351
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:34.862 --> 01:37.031
- What happened?
- Akiko...

01:37.031 --> 01:39.499
...is apparently entering
the court in the winter.

01:40.067 --> 01:41.534
I see...

01:41.869 --> 01:46.670
Although we had made a promise...
to see the fireflies together.

01:49.109 --> 01:53.013
Kyuuki has created another world
beyond the mirror of the water.

01:53.013 --> 01:56.744
A place you won't be able
to penetrate easily!

01:58.118 --> 01:59.553
Masahiro!

01:59.553 --> 02:01.221
How amazing!

02:01.221 --> 02:04.088
The priest has my curse
within him.

02:05.926 --> 02:09.054
Penetrate the Mirror Cage

02:09.897 --> 02:12.399
Everything is in order.

02:12.399 --> 02:15.502
Now we await the Princess's
entry into the palace tomorrow.

02:15.502 --> 02:17.671
Congratulations, Sir.

02:17.671 --> 02:22.301
Masahiro, you'll end the matter
by tonight, correct?

02:23.210 --> 02:25.379
- Yes.
- I see.

02:25.379 --> 02:27.915
- We're counting on you then.
- Masahiro,

02:27.915 --> 02:31.009
go check on Princess Akiko.

02:31.618 --> 02:35.247
I have private matters to
discuss with Lord Michinaga.

02:36.123 --> 02:37.852
I understand.

02:38.359 --> 02:40.122
Excuse me.

02:43.731 --> 02:45.499
What's wrong?

02:45.499 --> 02:47.334
Once Akiko enters
the court,

02:47.334 --> 02:50.701
I won't walk down
this hallway again.

02:52.740 --> 02:54.765
I'll wait here for you.

02:55.909 --> 02:58.400
Come on, get moving already.

03:01.382 --> 03:03.816
I'm getting a little sleepy.

03:12.326 --> 03:17.025
Congratulations, your highness,
on your court ceremony tomorrow.

03:17.531 --> 03:19.362
I haven't seen you
in a while...

03:20.534 --> 03:23.404
Masahiro, you seem
to have lost weight.

03:23.404 --> 03:26.306
I guess I might have
grown thinner...

03:26.306 --> 03:28.672
because I've been patrolling
the town every night.

03:29.176 --> 03:32.413
I was out of shape lately so
it works out for me perfectly.

03:32.413 --> 03:34.438
Well, if that's really
the case...

03:34.681 --> 03:38.118
You said it was possible to see
clearly through these blinds.

03:38.118 --> 03:40.454
- But that's not true.
- You shouldn't.

03:40.454 --> 03:44.124
Only the Mikado is allowed to
see your beauty from now on.

03:44.124 --> 03:46.354
Oh, that's right.

03:46.827 --> 03:50.197
Please forgive my manner
of speech, First Princess.

03:50.197 --> 03:51.892
It's Akiko.

03:53.167 --> 03:55.769
Please don't call me
First Princess.

03:55.769 --> 03:58.539
Call me Akiko, Masahiro.

03:58.539 --> 04:00.336
Akiko...

04:09.183 --> 04:11.048
The fireflies...

04:12.219 --> 04:16.490
I promise to show them
to you... someday.

04:16.490 --> 04:21.695
Even if I have to cast a spell, I'll
bring you the fireflies in Kifune.

04:21.695 --> 04:23.595
Masahiro...

04:23.897 --> 04:25.956
I give you my promise.

04:29.570 --> 04:31.105
Hey, Masahiro...

04:31.105 --> 04:34.141
Many unearthly beings
dwell in the palace, right?

04:34.141 --> 04:36.977
But I'll be safe...

04:36.977 --> 04:40.538
Because you'll protect
me, right?

04:41.682 --> 04:45.345
I'll protect you... forever.

04:46.587 --> 04:48.452
I believe in you.

05:07.040 --> 05:10.444
Grandfather, I have
to leave now.

05:10.444 --> 05:13.242
I'm sorry, but this is
something I must do.

05:21.488 --> 05:24.124
You're one of
Masahiro's spirits?

05:24.124 --> 05:26.649
I'll entrust my grandson
to you then.

05:27.094 --> 05:30.120
Kurumanosuke, we are
going to the south.

05:39.740 --> 05:43.267
Pond of Ogura...
In search of Kyuuki, right?

05:43.710 --> 05:45.200
Yeah.

05:47.147 --> 05:51.685
I'll wait for you south of
the capital at Pond of Ogura,

05:51.685 --> 05:54.518
within the large water
mirror over there.

05:58.458 --> 06:00.153
Masahiro!

06:00.294 --> 06:03.627
The curse...
Kyuuki is calling me...

06:04.097 --> 06:06.300
When Akiko makes her
court entry tomorrow,

06:06.300 --> 06:08.768
I'd have settled this already!

06:10.103 --> 06:13.173
At last, the time has come.

06:13.173 --> 06:16.665
Send someone to give them
a warm welcome.

06:19.179 --> 06:22.842
Dorou? Go ahead then.

06:25.319 --> 06:27.787
I'm waiting for you, priest.

06:29.790 --> 06:32.960
- Do you feel anything?
- No, I don't.

06:32.960 --> 06:36.157
But this means it's really
beyond the water mirror.

06:44.304 --> 06:45.931
Get back!

06:50.244 --> 06:52.312
Dorou, a foreign demon...

06:52.312 --> 06:54.212
Where is Kyuuki?

07:07.027 --> 07:08.722
Rikugou!

07:15.369 --> 07:18.930
Honor the prayers within,
deities that exist before time.

07:19.373 --> 07:21.742
Cast out the ogres,
read the words,

07:21.742 --> 07:23.710
dance for the dead.
Do it now!

07:31.685 --> 07:34.483
Welcome, priest.

07:38.659 --> 07:40.286
Masahiro!

07:43.297 --> 07:44.924
Masahiro...

07:49.202 --> 07:50.829
Masahiro...

07:57.477 --> 07:59.880
You've lost the boy
forever, shikigami.

07:59.880 --> 08:02.582
You have to concede defeat.

08:02.582 --> 08:06.211
You can never enter the world
that our master created.

08:07.421 --> 08:09.489
I don't need you here.

08:09.489 --> 08:12.459
You shall die here now
in the name of our master!

08:12.459 --> 08:14.086
Silence!

08:22.736 --> 08:25.728
What is this?
Where am I?

08:29.009 --> 08:30.310
Kyuuki...

08:30.310 --> 08:32.512
Welcome, I've been
waiting for you.

08:32.512 --> 08:36.380
Have you made the decision to
become one of my followers?

08:42.489 --> 08:44.889
Those are the people
who disappeared...

08:46.727 --> 08:49.821
They were killed and turned
into monsters!

09:08.648 --> 09:10.275
Guren!

09:11.651 --> 09:15.055
Become my follower, priest.

09:15.055 --> 09:16.716
I will never!

09:20.927 --> 09:23.953
Supreme deity, emperor of fire.

09:24.564 --> 09:28.056
Ten thousand demons, enfold!

09:37.444 --> 09:41.515
- That was pretty good.
- Kyuuki...

09:41.515 --> 09:44.985
I desire that power of yours.
Give it to me.

09:44.985 --> 09:47.954
- Why should I do that?!
- I've already told you.

09:47.954 --> 09:51.825
If you agree, I'll grant you
your heart's desire.

09:51.825 --> 09:55.529
My only desire...
is to bring you down!

09:55.529 --> 09:57.597
What if I told you that...

09:57.597 --> 10:00.623
I'd bring Fujiwara no Akiko
here to you?

10:07.507 --> 10:09.142
Akiko...

10:09.142 --> 10:11.344
Would you like me
to stop her...

10:11.344 --> 10:14.214
from spending her life
with the Mikado?

10:14.214 --> 10:18.218
I created this world
with my power.

10:18.218 --> 10:23.121
I can free Fujiwara no Akiko
from her destiny too.

10:31.798 --> 10:36.336
Isn't that what you really
desire deep in your heart?

10:36.336 --> 10:40.773
I can grant you a wish.
Yes, I can...

10:40.874 --> 10:44.776
Just a little more...
He's relenting...

10:47.681 --> 10:50.417
So priest, give me
your everything...

10:50.417 --> 10:53.687
and become my follower!

10:53.687 --> 10:56.256
Never!

10:56.256 --> 11:00.693
Why? Don't you want Fujiwara
no Akiko to belong to you?

11:01.261 --> 11:02.963
Because there are no
fireflies here.

11:02.963 --> 11:05.532
It's pointless if
there're no fireflies!

11:05.532 --> 11:09.336
So I must defeat you
today, Kyuuki!

11:09.336 --> 11:12.839
Let this spell end your atrocious
evil, anonymous purifier.

11:12.839 --> 11:15.308
Do it now!

11:15.308 --> 11:21.543
[chant]

11:36.029 --> 11:37.864
Just as I expected.

11:37.864 --> 11:42.267
Your blood rejuvenates me,
enhancing my power and strength.

11:43.737 --> 11:46.506
You don't have to be
my follower...

11:46.506 --> 11:49.600
I'll just have to
kill you right now!

11:56.850 --> 12:00.013
Seiryuu, Tenitsu, Genbu.

12:04.224 --> 12:05.525
What is it?

12:05.525 --> 12:08.187
I want you to do
something for me.

12:29.616 --> 12:33.950
It's all right. We've already
completed our mission.

12:36.256 --> 12:37.951
Masahiro...

12:48.034 --> 12:50.332
Don't bother.
It's no use.

12:53.607 --> 12:56.303
- Masahiro...
- Guren!

12:57.444 --> 12:59.378
Masahiro is calling me!

13:00.146 --> 13:02.307
Guren!

13:10.423 --> 13:13.259
Your blood is incredible, priest.

13:13.259 --> 13:17.218
Just a little of it has made
me recover so much.

13:20.433 --> 13:22.697
Meet your doom, priest!

13:23.737 --> 13:26.262
Guren!

13:32.712 --> 13:35.281
Guren, Rikugou, you are here!

13:35.281 --> 13:37.215
You'll pay for that!

13:42.122 --> 13:44.420
- Go now.
- Thank you!

13:47.927 --> 13:49.554
Rikugou!

13:53.366 --> 13:54.958
Masahiro!

14:07.247 --> 14:09.044
Masahiro...

14:12.085 --> 14:13.677
Princess...

14:14.487 --> 14:16.289
Who are you?

14:16.289 --> 14:19.426
I'm Tenitsu, one of
Abe no Seimei's familiars,

14:19.426 --> 14:21.758
and one of the twelve
shikigami spirits.

14:22.562 --> 14:25.998
My name is Genbu.
I'm also one of the shikigami.

14:26.900 --> 14:28.835
What can I do for you?

14:28.835 --> 14:31.705
Princess Akiko,
we need your help...

14:31.705 --> 14:35.208
to save Masahiro,
Seimei's young grandson.

14:35.208 --> 14:39.144
Masahiro is engaged in a battle
with Kyuuki in another world.

14:39.846 --> 14:43.249
- Masahiro...
- To save him...

14:43.249 --> 14:46.653
We have to open a path
leading to the other world.

14:46.653 --> 14:49.689
And we'll need the charm
you carry with you.

14:49.689 --> 14:51.224
My charm?

14:51.224 --> 14:53.852
It's that sachet, Princess.

14:55.061 --> 14:58.431
Masahiro's spiritual power
is within it.

14:58.431 --> 15:00.867
In order to link
the two worlds,

15:00.867 --> 15:03.269
we need an item that has
Masahiro's spiritual power.

15:03.269 --> 15:06.106
It is of utmost importance.
Please help us.

15:06.106 --> 15:08.199
I understand.
Please take it.

15:09.342 --> 15:11.310
Thank you.

15:12.645 --> 15:14.135
Farewell.

15:20.420 --> 15:23.389
Masahiro, nothing must
happen to you...

15:23.389 --> 15:25.323
Akiko, there you are.

15:25.725 --> 15:29.422
There's something I must tell
you. Please brace yourself.

15:30.663 --> 15:32.358
Master Seimei...

15:36.603 --> 15:39.873
- Masahiro!
- I'll kill him if you come near.

15:39.873 --> 15:42.341
You won't be spared either.

15:45.445 --> 15:49.482
Trust in... the strength...
of the supreme deities...

15:49.482 --> 15:54.187
- What's he...
- and honor... them...

15:54.187 --> 15:57.891
You're in pain, priest?
But I won't kill you so easily.

15:57.891 --> 16:01.528
I will eat you
bit by bit...

16:01.528 --> 16:06.199
Dividing constellations...
of adversity...

16:06.199 --> 16:08.768
- Masahiro!
- How weak...

16:08.768 --> 16:11.828
Is that all the power
you have?

16:13.773 --> 16:15.741
Why are you smiling?

16:26.119 --> 16:28.521
Darn, those spells on you...

16:28.521 --> 16:32.392
Deity of Kifune, please grant
me your divine protection!

16:32.392 --> 16:36.763
How dare you! You had this
planned right from the beginning!

16:36.763 --> 16:39.132
If you manage to
bind this evil spirit,

16:39.132 --> 16:44.331
you'll definitely be duly
rewarded by the Fudou myou-ou!

16:45.038 --> 16:49.475
So this is the power...
that Seimei's heir possesses.

16:51.010 --> 16:52.500
What?!

16:52.846 --> 16:57.909
I do not fear that deity of
yours. Prepare to die!

17:01.454 --> 17:03.217
What is this?

17:03.857 --> 17:07.816
Sword of Gouma,
forged by Abe no Seimei.

17:09.229 --> 17:10.821
Seiryuu?

17:13.533 --> 17:15.524
What are you doing?

17:19.205 --> 17:21.036
Masahiro!

17:21.641 --> 17:23.541
Kyuuki!

17:34.320 --> 17:36.155
The command of
the electric deity!

17:36.155 --> 17:39.556
Do it right now!

17:57.844 --> 18:01.405
You can choose to
believe me or not.

18:01.915 --> 18:05.407
But be warned that
I am infallible.

18:07.687 --> 18:09.355
Masahiro?

18:09.355 --> 18:11.084
Masahiro!

18:13.426 --> 18:14.961
Mokkun...

18:14.961 --> 18:19.523
Thank goodness! I was so afraid
that you wouldn't wake up!

18:21.801 --> 18:25.100
Let me heal the worst
of your wounds.

18:33.246 --> 18:36.616
Princess Akiko lent
this to us.

18:36.616 --> 18:38.418
Akiko...

18:38.418 --> 18:42.616
We used it to send Seiryuu
beyond the water mirror.

18:42.855 --> 18:46.347
Thanks to Akiko and you guys...

18:47.193 --> 18:49.718
I'm still alive.

18:50.330 --> 18:52.025
Oh, come on.

18:54.534 --> 18:56.365
It's over at last.

19:01.407 --> 19:04.399
The princess is on her way
to the palace.

19:05.445 --> 19:07.709
It's magnificent!

19:35.641 --> 19:38.578
Masahiro, you've come
back safely.

19:38.578 --> 19:40.847
I know that you need
some rest...

19:40.847 --> 19:43.216
But we have an
important visitor.

19:43.216 --> 19:44.808
Yes...

19:45.451 --> 19:47.419
You may come in.

19:50.923 --> 19:53.626
It's our responsibility
to take care of...

19:53.626 --> 19:55.753
the Princess from
today onwards.

19:59.098 --> 20:02.702
It's a shame, but a curse
was cast on her...

20:02.702 --> 20:05.038
and it can never be removed.

20:05.038 --> 20:06.973
The situation now
is such that...

20:06.973 --> 20:09.635
an onmyouji must always
be by her side.

20:11.244 --> 20:13.508
I'm counting on you.

20:16.049 --> 20:20.119
Hey... But how?! I don't
understand! Tell me!

20:20.119 --> 20:22.588
If Akiko had entered
the palace,

20:22.588 --> 20:25.625
the curse might bring harm
to the Mikado.

20:25.625 --> 20:29.228
But stopping the entrance
ceremony wasn't an option.

20:29.228 --> 20:31.597
Then who was the one
who married the Mikado?!

20:31.597 --> 20:34.267
Lord Michinaga has
another daughter,

20:34.267 --> 20:37.904
Princess Shouko, who's born
of a different mother.

20:37.904 --> 20:40.702
They look almost identical.

20:42.041 --> 20:43.976
What if someone finds out?

20:43.976 --> 20:46.212
Once she's in the palace,
she'll only be...

20:46.212 --> 20:48.848
seen though bamboo blinds.
No one will find out.

20:48.848 --> 20:51.617
- You sneaky old man.
- Guren.

20:51.617 --> 20:54.745
You'll be the one
to tell Masahiro then.

20:59.258 --> 21:01.123
Masahiro?

21:02.995 --> 21:06.487
Shall we go to Kifune next year
and see the fireflies?

21:08.334 --> 21:10.199
It's a promise.

21:13.673 --> 21:15.937
Yes, I will keep my word.

21:22.849 --> 21:26.182
I'll give them a little
more time together.

21:42.702 --> 21:54.113
Fukai yami no naka de kimi
no koe ga kikoeta

21:54.113 --> 22:05.491
"Shinjiteru" tada hitokoto boku
no kokoro ni hibiite kita

22:05.491 --> 22:11.230
Itsumo kimi ga soba ni
ite kureta ne

22:11.230 --> 22:17.066
Itsumo boku ni yuuki kurete ita

22:19.138 --> 22:29.549
Boku-tachi no mirai wo
mamoritsuzukeru tame ni

22:29.549 --> 22:36.322
Taisetsu na kimi ni
yakusokusuru yo

22:36.322 --> 22:41.427
Boku wa akiramenai

22:41.427 --> 22:47.300
Motto motto boku wa
boku wo koete

22:47.300 --> 22:54.103
Kitto kitto kitto

22:59.645 --> 23:02.478
Next Episode

23:23.603 --> 23:25.204
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.204 --> 23:26.572
Episode 13.

23:26.572 --> 23:26.672
The Evil Song Brought by
the Whirlwind.

23:26.672 --> 23:29.072
Episode 13
The Evil Song Brought by
the Whirlwind
The Evil Song Brought by
the Whirlwind.
